      "text": "Agent events arrive via two transports — a hook shim writing to a Unix socket (named pipe on Windows) with a 200ms fire-and-forget bound, and JSONL transcript watching — feeding one channel whose reducer folds events into office state for a half-block pixel-art renderer."
